  background-color: #111;
  color: #fff;
}

#night-mode-toggle:checked ~ .toggle-label:before {
  background-color: #fff;
}

/* Toggle switch styles */
.toggle-label:before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  display: block;
  width: 80px;
  height: 40px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  background-color: #ccc;
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
}

.toggle-label:after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 0;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  display: block;
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: #fff;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

#night-mode-toggle:checked ~ .toggle-label:before {
  background-color: #2196F3;
}

#night-mode-toggle:checked ~ .toggle-label:after {
  transform: translate(48px, -50%);
}
```

This will position the toggle switch in the center of the screen over the content, and make it cover the entire screen in night mode. When the toggle switch is clicked, the "checked" state of the checkbox will be triggered, which will activate the night mode styles. 

